+    This module implements the video boot driver for the Raspberry Pi 2 (the
+    ARM FW\MIPS\JXDISP.C). The display is a 32 bit per pixel frame buffer the
+    VideoCore allocates through the mailbox property interface; colors are
+    drawn from the G364 palette in the pixel order the VideoCore grants.
=1 14 9
=1 24 5
+#include "bcmvdeo.h"
